      "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The cobbled bruiser is reduced to 0 Hit Points</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> A Weakened Cobbleswarm spawns in the space the cobbled bruiser previously occupied, or the nearest adjacent space if there is already a cobbleswarm occupying that space. It is slightly damaged compared to a normal Cobbleswarm; its AC is 14 instead of 16, and it has one-half of its usual maximum Hit Points (10 instead of 20).</p>",
